 "recap": [
  "Pseudo verbs go with a main verb: dápat (must), maáarì / puwéde (can), kailángan (need to), ibig / gustó (like), áyaw (does not like).",
  "The main verb is always in the infinitive: Dapat kumáin ng gulay ang mga batà.",
  "Ibig and gustó take kong, mong… between them and the main verb: Gustó kong mag-áral ng Tagálog.",
  "Other pseudo verbs: siyáng with an active verb, niyáng with an -in verb.",
  "Pseudo verbs ending in a vowel take -ng (gustóng, puwédeng); kailangan takes -g."
 ]
